  "description": [
    "Keeps a camera centered and zoomed on a changing set of objects instead of a fixed view of the whole level.",
    "Use cases:",
    "- A construction or crafting game where the camera should follow the current build.",
    "- A strategy game following a group of selected units.",
    "- Any scene where the important area shrinks or grows over time."
  ],
